      guideBack: "One way it could sound",
      description: "When she feels financially or structurally unsafe, causing her to get edgy or critical. The challenge is to provide deep stability using Stabilize the Frame and Track her Priorities.\n\n• Stabilize the Frame — take ownership of the budget and future security\n• Track her Priorities — check in on her worries before they turn into panic\n\nThe key question is: are you drifting in your career, or are you delivering stability as an act of love?\n\nMindset: delivering stability is an act of deep Masculine love.",
