      guideFront: "Choose a strategy when...",
      guideBack: "One way it could sound",
      description: "When domestic logistics, scheduling, and mental labor are carried primarily by one partner, use initiative and gratitude to restore balance.\n\n• Mental load is the exhausting mental work of anticipating, planning, and managing household needs.\n• Taking initiative as a \"co-CEO\" builds trust and proves you are fully invested in the partnership.",
      inputs: [
        { q: "Your partner asks why they always have to be the one to remind you about household supplies.", a: "\"You're right—that's mental load you shouldn't have to carry alone. I'll handle inventory from now on.\" [Sharing the Mental Load]", bundle: 'pro', guideBack: "A task you take on" },
        { q: "You see a stack of school permission slips and medical forms on the counter.", a: "\"I'll fill out these forms and drop them off tomorrow so it's taken care of.\" [Sharing the Mental Load]", bundle: 'pro', guideBack: "A task you take on" },
        { q: "Your partner looks overwhelmed trying to coordinate weekend schedules for the kids.", a: "\"Thank you for managing so much of the family calendar. Let me take over the driving schedule this week.\" [Out-Loud Appreciation]", bundle: 'pro', guideBack: "Specific thanks, with the reason" },
        { q: "You want to check if the division of labor in your home feels fair to your partner.", a: "\"How are we doing on mutual chores? Do you feel like things are fair, or am I leaving too much on you?\" [The Weekly Check-in]", bundle: 'pro', guideBack: "A check-in question" },
        { q: "You notice the dog needs a vet appointment and vaccinations updated.", a: "\"I called the vet and scheduled the appointment for Tuesday morning.\" [Sharing the Mental Load]", bundle: 'pro', guideBack: "A task you take on" },
        { q: "You catch yourself asking \"what can I do to help?\" instead of taking initiative.", a: "(Look around the house, identify the dirtiest room, and clean it without asking) [Sharing the Mental Load]", bundle: 'pro', guideBack: "A task you take on" },
        { q: "You want to validate the invisible planning your partner did for a smooth family trip.", a: "\"I saw how much work went into packing and planning for this trip. Thank you for taking care of us.\" [Out-Loud Appreciation]", bundle: 'pro', guideBack: "Specific thanks, with the reason" },
        { q: "You want to evaluate domestic labor during a calm, non-confrontational discussion.", a: "\"Are there any household tasks where you feel alone or unsupported? I want to adjust our routine.\" [The Weekly Check-in]", bundle: 'pro', guideBack: "A check-in question" },
      ]
