      description: "Stopping the reflex to police her private thoughts, demand mind-reading enthusiasm, or guess her hidden motives.\n\nThis challenge trains you to evaluate your partnership exclusively through concrete actions and compliance.\n• **Action-Based Affirmation** — evaluate partnership by concrete compliance and respectful behavior\n• **Power-Talk Calibration** — focus on real-world results rather than private thoughts\n\nMindset: private thoughts belong to her; concrete compliance builds reality.",
